      "justification": "Patient presents with cough, fever, and dyspnea consistent with community-acquired pneumonia. IV fluids support hydration and hemodynamic stability. This is the only available action in the current phase and is appropriate supportive care while awaiting pending labs (CBC, procalcitonin) and imaging results. Vitals are currently stable, but IV access and fluid support are standard of care in pneumonia management."
    },
